    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109605" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόχῠτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποχέω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>having</i> something <i>poured in,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. οἶνος</span> wine 
			<i>that has been 'doctored',</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phryn.Com.
				65
			</span></i>, cf. Timachid. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				1.31e
			</span></i>: metaph. of a person, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ κακῶς γεγονώς</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				3.56
			</span></i> (= <i><span class="en">
				<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
				100
			</span></i>).</div>
